. Qualche piano più in su c'è Paloma Josse, una bambina di undici anni arguta e sagace, decisa a suicidarsi il giorno del suo dodicesimo compleanno. Renée e Paloma, una donna e una bambina che emergono per intelligenza e conoscenze dall'abietto tessuto sociale contemporaneo, condannandosi in questo modo a un esilio intellettuale che impedisce loro di manifestarsi nel mondo.","tagline":"Fintamente indolente, risolutamente solitario, terribilmente elegante"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Hedgehog","overview":"Paloma is a serious and highly articulate but deeply bored 11-year-old who has decided to kill herself on her 12th birthday. Fascinated by art and philosophy, she questions and documents her life and immediate circle, drawing trenchant and often hilarious observations on the world around her. But as her appointment with death approaches, Paloma finally meets some kindred spirits in her building's grumpy janitor and an enigmatic, elegant neighbor, both of whom inspire Paloma to question her rather pessimistic outlook on life.","tagline":"Let Life In."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"L'histoire d'une rencontre inattendue: celle de Paloma Josse, petite fille de 11 ans, redoutablement intelligente et suicidaire, de Renée Michel, concierge parisienne discrète et solitaire, et de l'énigmatique Monsieur Kakuro Ozu.","tagline":"Laissez entrer la vie."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Jp0RS7ftenYQROxnxjOpzJW0cj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/brOMTLeCIz0LBt4jxMp1658aT45.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":19597,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1Jp0RS7ftenYQROxnxjOpzJW0cj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1Jp0RS7ftenYQROxnxjOpzJW0cj.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1800}